{"matched":52,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0554c01","n":"0554c","t":"第三頌唯識真性就初有二初"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0555a01","n":"0555a","t":"名勝義無自性性於諸法中若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0555b01","n":"0555b","t":"有七名謂真如無我性空性無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0555c01","n":"0555c","t":"訖自下五頌明唯識所入之位"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0556a01","n":"0556a","t":"經時十三住等略為五也大果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0556b01","n":"0556b","t":"姓此是未種解脫分善名本種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0557a01","n":"0557a","t":"薩第十地菩薩雖皆遍有可名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0557b01","n":"0557b","t":"勝解行住謂諸菩薩從初發心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0557c01","n":"0557c","t":"攝以彼論言從初發心乃至未"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0558a01","n":"0558a","t":"無數大劫謂勝解行者經初無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0558b01","n":"0558b","t":"身餓獸故如別抄會此時長遠"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0558c01","n":"0558c","t":"前六菩薩第七一種菩薩如來"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0559a01","n":"0559a","t":"心堅固不退齊此方名初劫之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0559b01","n":"0559b","t":"者蓋欲以彼顯此菩提亦利有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0559c01","n":"0559c","t":"諸麁行名住外門修菩薩行問"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0560a01","n":"0560a","t":"滅一切煩惱下此論文資糧道"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0560b01","n":"0560b","t":"後釋名以薩迦耶見為首由我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0560c01","n":"0560c","t":"見疑無明愛恚慢等者此出體"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0561a01","n":"0561a","t":"計度無明迷故佛地論說有義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0561b01","n":"0561b","t":"者見道斷既許五識中惑通見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0561c01","n":"0561c","t":"法執時非必有故勝鬘經說世"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0562a01","n":"0562a","t":"第二地等亦復如是不可依地"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0562b01","n":"0562b","t":"有餘果證名梵行已立凡夫人"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0562c01","n":"0562c","t":"三有品迷事理惑約界論之後"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0563a01","n":"0563a","t":"盡而細分別者及二障中若麁"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0563b01","n":"0563b","t":"不護如無畏三念住非根攝無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0563c01","n":"0563c","t":"靜慮修四無量名福若依靜慮"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0564a01","n":"0564a","t":"身而住明知種姓住未入僧祇"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0564b01","n":"0564b","t":"且舉菩提後且舉轉依論實皆"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0564c01","n":"0564c","t":"猶豫故擇簡見品彼不擇故疑"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0565a01","n":"0565a","t":"得此名加功萬行方行初位亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0565b01","n":"0565b","t":"謂諸菩薩由四尋思於一切法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0565c01","n":"0565c","t":"說自體推求此能詮所詮定不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0566a01","n":"0566a","t":"伏除頂是上位伏除以初伏除"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0566b01","n":"0566b","t":"然依他中名等名假者法無名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0566c01","n":"0566c","t":"名然不如此中彼不別分中上"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0567a01","n":"0567a","t":"故由有此相未證真理滅空有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0567b01","n":"0567b","t":"證故緣一切境非皆證解或比"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0567c01","n":"0567c","t":"依自體唯有堪能非不堪能麁"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0568a01","n":"0568a","t":"不現行俱生二取未全伏滅如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0568b01","n":"0568b","t":"入現觀六十九中何故但言靜"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0568c01","n":"0568c","t":"別今至修皆遍緣但名已知收"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0569a01","n":"0569a","t":"法世發心法滅後方成熟久已"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0569b01","n":"0569b","t":"者識體合如冥然無取無攀緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0569c01","n":"0569c","t":"前第七卷四緣中解若爾心王"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0570a01","n":"0570a","t":"二空頓證二障頓斷或三心究"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0570b01","n":"0570b","t":"能廣法故此初汎說為相見道"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0570c01","n":"0570c","t":"道不作三心緣四諦故如對法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0571b01","n":"0571b","t":"不是相違然五十五仍說從見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0572b01","n":"0572b","t":"親緣於無此文理證也述曰總"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0572c01","n":"0572c","t":"察名廣分別煖等無此能不如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0573b01","n":"0573b","t":"能自知況此菩薩利樂一切利"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷009b","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":102,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}